        "to"
      ],
      "title": "Period",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "The week to report: a named past week or an explicit Monday-to-Sunday {from, to} (W2).\nThe SQL also refuses a week that has not ended yet (it knows the business date).",
